# The VM performs ZERO retailer egress: collection runs on GitHub Actions
# (.github/workflows/collect.yml, rotating cloud egress — the home IP is
# Akamai-blocked for Tesco and was 403'd by Dunnes on 08-30; ff-07) and
# discovery runs in CI too (.github/workflows/rediscover.yml). This crontab
# only pulls the CI batch (whole-run idempotent; needs GITHUB_TOKEN in the
# container env, actions:read PAT) and runs the liveness signal.
40 */4 * * * python -m beverage_feed pull-batch
# R5 liveness signal: log freshest observation age per retailer once daily.
# Passive (always exits 0, read-only); the line lands in supercronic logs.
5 5 * * * python -m beverage_feed freshness
5 5 * * * python -m beverage_feed freshness
